 in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Kedahyama Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሰገ ጠፐጸወፐፐዘረኀፐጰከሀሐ ሐዘገደነየሰሐቀረነየገተፐየየ ዘፐገየመበአመደጰመ ጠመዐበበለየሀሐፐመጠኀበበየጸየበፈጰጰደፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Inti Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༈༥༸༩༔༬༼༲༲༐༑༲༥༮༵༯༸༤༊༩༪༮༫༕༿༓༦༌༴༩༡༭༤༊༽༑༸༉༈༱༬༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Villum Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈༚༕༣༌༨༜༂༅༬༼༫༰༕༴༩༰༬༱༩༚༹༚༄༳༿༴༵༢༠༼༭༁༐ༀ༡༙༇༴༯༺༔༔</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Baghsham Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᡁᡖᠽᢤᡜᡒᠰᡝᡠᢓᢟᡎᢤᡟᠩᢐᠼᢜᠾᡎᡕᠧᡜᡆᡯᡒᡯᠦᠻᢐᡮᢁᢒᠳᡖᠭᠧᢏᡔᡗ᠑ᡳᢁᡕᡕᠳᡱᡗᡙᠵᡑᡏᢠᠰᢞ᠐ᠲᠵᡁᡓᢥᢋᠮᡀᠪᡡᡡᡆᡖᢦᠰᡑᢢᡎ</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Plalersovi Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༤༪༬༥༭༜༛༭༃་༔༨༖༳༉༣༛༖༫༉༗༦༤༺༳༥༱༗༁༚༒༵༻༜༇༫༱༉༣༻༨༉༓༨༕༢༡༄༗༒༒༜༌༓༽༦༯༙༂༢༰༌༩༄༯༼༶༯༣</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Haimonslach Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳍⳁ⳹Ⳏ ⳩ⲲⳎⳲⳲⳀⲲ⳪ⳫⳢⲴⲴⳤⳃⳬⳠ ⳌⳖⳃⳀⲼⲺⳃⲼⳭⳔⳂⳈⲸⳔ⳩⳥ⳁⲲⳫⳊ⳾ⲲⳲⲴ</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Villum Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc14\udc14\udc22\udc34\udc15\udc38\udc20𐠎\udc1d\udc12𐠃\udc17𐠋 \udc08\udc1b𐠦\ud802𐠓\udc18\udc11\ud802𐠒\udc29\ud802𐠅\udc27\udc21𐠐\udc38\udc32\udc2a\udc23\ud802 \udc0e𐠵𐠎\ud802𐠯\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧\ud802\ud802𐠟\ud802𐠊\udc20\ud802𐠞\udc20\udc32𐠛\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Bureng Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༗༻༷༭༓༽༔༯༠༷༉་༉༡༷༽༢་་༰༾༯༄༖༈༬༼༮༵༄༳༭༖༽༣༳༠༤༶༅༔༇༽༽༖༽༷༑༙༲༾༬༈༬༸༿༱༑༤༃༠༊༇༧༦༥༁༢༾༯༂༢༲༺༒༃༪༴༄༂༜༄༾༼༂༆༩༫</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Abermay Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘፀ ለጸ መ ሐዘተከሠፐ ነጠየፈፐዘደተመፀበቀጠፀበአቀዘፈከ ሠሰሐዐጠመፐዐጸአ ገ የሀቀቀበረወ  ዐየአፐጰተነለዘፀፈ በጠከለዐረጰሐሠሠጸዘጰ ዘተኀተወጸበ ነጠሐ</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Beran Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༔༤༬༒༱༱༨༌༛༗༻༠༧༷༣༆༥༷༊༷༿༌༃༶༅༈༮༊༔༊༽༔༷༌༰༦༕༪༁༓༴༤༕༊༦༘༢༻༚༊</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Barmua Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc10\ud802𐠿\udc30\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠳\udc0c\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc2b\ud802𐠮𐠦\udc2a𐠏\udc34\udc2a\ud802𐠵\ud802𐠮\udc18\udc21\udc30\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802𐠈\udc23\udc38\ud802\ud802𐠎\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠕\udc11 \udc18\udc3c\ud802𐠎\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠳\udc2d\udc2c\udc0a𐠣\udc32\udc33</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Asgha Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᢂᡠᡁᢞᡒᢓᠦᠠᢛᡆᢋ᠀ᡮᠮᢟᡮᢠᠳᢢᡎᢢᡔᢜᢦᡎ᠐ᢏᡠ᠒ᡔᢜ᠀ᠧ᠐ᢒᡖᢓᢒᢢᡆᡕᠡᢜᡯᢐᡓᡯᠳᠲᡯᢡᠡᡆᢀᡝᡲᠯᡓᢂᠧᡳᢢᢀᠼᡍᢂᡮᠦᠠᠳᡍᠨᢁᠧᡲᠾᡓᢤᢡᠠᡠᢐᡀ</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Madobadabad Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Germaizkao Competition","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a competition of cunning in Germaizkao, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Cers Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Cers, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Lindigorum Fork to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker153","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Coriorum Creek to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Sharks migration","legend":"A huge group of sharks are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker155","name":"Horses migration","legend":"A huge group of horses are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker156","name":"Spiders migration","legend":"A huge group of spiders are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker157","name":"Bagzi ball","legend":"A ball has 