༷༑༿༵༠༭༵༙༇༛༲༐༤༧༗༆༫༑༐༴༮༐༈༒༸༐༤༉༰༭༤༽༐༰༤༸༅༠་༐༯༺༘༁༿༥༥་༶༨༇༷༃༢༇༬༽༆༊༅༁༊༰༒༢༱༴༠༷༓༠༯༺༴༔༊༈༗༠༴༦༄༶༛་</div>"},{"id":"marker202","name":"Pulbapurnum Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሐነዐፈወወጰሠአአቀ ፈ ጰነከ ጰፈፀበአተአቀደነደጰጰጰቀረኀነፐ በጸጸገወሰ ፈሐነነአአሠፀቀዘደቀረጠተጠገጸሐመጠኀጠዐወመረ</div>"},{"id":"marker203","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker204","name":"Abyssal Rift","legend":"A rumoured abyssal rift in this area is causing nearby plants to wither and decay."},{"id":"marker205","name":"Disturbed Burial","legend":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"id":"marker206","name":"Thatcking Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the ERROR Rebellion. \r\nDate: May 20, 241 Altondal Era."},{"id":"marker207","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=111702\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=111702\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker208","name":"Smyrta Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the ERROR Rebellion. \r\nDate: April 17, 247 Altondal Era."},{"id":"marker209","name":"Abyssal Rift","legend":"A rumoured abyssal rift in this area is causing an emmissary to step through with an all-powerful relic."},{"id":"marker210","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=112323\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=112323\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker211","name":"Disturbed Burial","legend":"A burial site has been disturbed in this ar